	"VersionNumber": 1,
	"ResourceName": "okta_ip_denylist",
	"Description": "Tuning control for $OKTA_TUNING: force Okta detections involving watchlisted source addresses up to at least priority High, even when the risk score alone would not reach it.\n\nFields: key,enabled,min_risk,reason\n  - key: the bare source IP address, matched against src (clientIp, else the first hop of request.ipChain)\n  - enabled: 1 to apply the row, 0 to park it without deleting it\n  - min_risk: only promote once risk_score reaches this value; leave empty or 0 to always promote\n  - reason: free text, so the next analyst knows why the address is watched\n\nCurrent contents:\nkey,enabled,min_risk,reason\n198.51.100.77,1,0,known bad egress - always promote to High\n203.0.113.99,1,65,watchlist IP - promote once risk reaches 65\n\nUsage:\n$OKTA_RISK_SCORE\n$OKTA_TUNING",
	"Labels": [
